# SigNoz schema fragment.
# @requires eks-platform
#
# SIGNOZ_NAMESPACE was a duplicate of the row already in base.manifest, with
# a conflicting fixed:signoz constraint that would have rejected UAT's real
# value (signoz-uat) -- removed 2026-07-31 (Issue #4); base.manifest's
# dns-label validator is authoritative.
#
# SIGNOZ_VERSION, SIGNOZ_K8S_INFRA_VERSION, SIGNOZ_STORAGE_CLASS,
# SIGNOZ_OTEL_ENDPOINT, and SIGNOZ_CLICKHOUSE_SECRET_NAME were removed the
# same day: declared here since Phase 3 planning but never consumed by any
# script, Terraform module, or Kubernetes manifest (verified via repo-wide
# search, including scripts/lib/packages/50-signoz/). The real values are
# hardcoded directly in gitops/signoz/base/helmreleases.yaml -- see
# docs/references/signoz-platform-contract.md for the documented mapping.
